<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<scxml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml" xmlns:h="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" version="1.0" name="Suggestion" initial="idle"><metadata><h:section id="documentation"><h:h2>Suggestion — actor contract</h:h2><h:p><h:strong>Actor invariant: </h:strong>I/O processor handles server generation; model requests are cancellable and budgeted.</h:p><h:p><h:strong>Specification: </h:strong>ACT-SUGGESTION in <h:a href="../system.xml">system.xml</h:a>. These comments use XHTML namespace h: and are not executable SCXML actions.</h:p><h:h3>I/O contracts invoked by this actor</h:h3><h:ul><h:li><h:a href="../io-processors.xml#IO-GENERATE">review.gemini.generate</h:a> — GenerateRequest → GenerateResult | Fault; external-write, bounded-transient, 10000 ms max. <h:a href="../io-messages.xsd">XSD</h:a>; flows: FL-010, FL-012, FL-027, FL-028; requirements: REQ-031, REQ-032, REQ-034, REQ-035, REQ-036, REQ-037</h:li><h:li><h:a href="../io-processors.xml#IO-PROPOSAL-SAVE">review.proposal.save</h:a> — ProposalSaveRequest → ProposalSaveResult | Fault; external-write, safe-idempotent, 10000 ms max. <h:a href="../io-messages.xsd">XSD</h:a>; flows: FL-012, FL-013; requirements: REQ-037, REQ-038</h:li></h:ul></h:section></metadata><state id="idle">
    <metadata><h:section id="state-idle"><h:h3>State: idle</h:h3><h:ul><h:li><h:code>suggestion.request</h:code> → generating</h:li></h:ul><h:p>I/O result events are delivered only after the corresponding processor returns a schema-valid result. On fault, apply the operation-specific failureHandling contract, never a silent success transition.</h:p></h:section></metadata><transition event="suggestion.request" target="generating"/>
  </state>
  <state id="generating">
    <metadata><h:section id="state-generating"><h:h3>State: generating</h:h3><h:ul><h:li><h:code>suggestion.ready</h:code> → proposed<h:a href="../io-processors.xml#IO-GENERATE"> [typed result: IO-GENERATE]</h:a><h:a href="../io-processors.xml#IO-PROPOSAL-SAVE"> [typed result: IO-PROPOSAL-SAVE]</h:a></h:li><h:li><h:code>suggestion.failed</h:code> → failed<h:a href="../io-processors.xml#IO-GENERATE"> [typed result: IO-GENERATE]</h:a></h:li></h:ul><h:p>I/O result events are delivered only after the corresponding processor returns a schema-valid result. On fault, apply the operation-specific failureHandling contract, never a silent success transition.</h:p></h:section></metadata><transition event="suggestion.ready" target="proposed"/>
    <transition event="suggestion.failed" target="failed"/>
  </state>
  <state id="proposed">
    <metadata><h:section id="state-proposed"><h:h3>State: proposed</h:h3><h:ul><h:li><h:code>suggestion.revise</h:code> → refining</h:li></h:ul><h:p>I/O result events are delivered only after the corresponding processor returns a schema-valid result. On fault, apply the operation-specific failureHandling contract, never a silent success transition.</h:p></h:section></metadata><transition event="suggestion.revise" target="refining"/>
  </state>
  <state id="refining">
    <metadata><h:section id="state-refining"><h:h3>State: refining</h:h3><h:ul><h:li><h:code>suggestion.ready</h:code> → proposed<h:a href="../io-processors.xml#IO-GENERATE"> [typed result: IO-GENERATE]</h:a><h:a href="../io-processors.xml#IO-PROPOSAL-SAVE"> [typed result: IO-PROPOSAL-SAVE]</h:a></h:li></h:ul><h:p>I/O result events are delivered only after the corresponding processor returns a schema-valid result. On fault, apply the operation-specific failureHandling contract, never a silent success transition.</h:p></h:section></metadata><transition event="suggestion.ready" target="proposed"/>
  </state>
  <state id="failed">
    <metadata><h:section id="state-failed"><h:h3>State: failed</h:h3><h:ul><h:li><h:code>suggestion.request</h:code> → generating</h:li></h:ul><h:p>I/O result events are delivered only after the corresponding processor returns a schema-valid result. On fault, apply the operation-specific failureHandling contract, never a silent success transition.</h:p></h:section></metadata><transition event="suggestion.request" target="generating"/>
  </state>
</scxml>
